:48.94,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,求｜も#｜とめるならば　どこまでもComment: 0,0:02:48.94,0:02:51.51,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,変｜かわらぬキズナ振｜ふりかざそうComment: 0,0:02:58.95,0:03:05.82,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,君｜き#｜みと本｜ほん気｜！きで心｜＜こ#｜こ#｜ろぶつけ슴｜あった喜｜＜よ#｜ろ#｜こびもComment: 0,0:03:05.82,0:03:13.13,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,笑｜わ#｜らい転｜こ#｜ろげてナミダ乾｜か#｜わかした切｜せ#｜つなさもComment: 0,0:03:13.13,0:03:19.97,Kanji Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,繋｜つ#｜なぎあわせて風｜か#｜ぜの中｜な#｜か　あぁComment: 0,0:03:19.97,0:03:26.74,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,はためいているよ　高｜た#｜かく　高｜た#｜かくComment: 0,0:03:26.74,0:03:29.91,Kanji Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,Why　探｜さ#｜がすことを諦｜＜あ#｜き#｜らめたのComment: 0,0:03:29.91,0:03:33.32,Kanji Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,Why　独｜ひ#｜とり闘｜＜た#｜た#｜かい続｜つ#｜づけるのComment: 0,0:03:33.32,0:03:36.22,Kanji Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,ねえ　どんな未｜み来｜！ら#｜い　覚｜か#｜く悟｜！ごしたのComment: 0,0:03:36.22,0:03:39.92,Kanji Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,夢｜ゆ#｜めはもう手｜てにしたのComment: 0,0:03:40.12,0:03:43.99,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,目｜めを閉｜とじて耳｜み#｜みを澄｜すましてComment: 0,0:03:43.99,0:03:47.43,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,探｜さ#｜がし出｜だそう　君｜き#｜みの答｜こ#｜たえをComment: 0,0:03:47.43,0:03:50.63,Kanji Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,道｜み#｜ちは必｜＜か#｜な#｜らず　続｜つ#｜づいているよComment: 0,0:03:50.63,0:03:53.17,Kanji Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,まだ見｜みたことのない海｜う#｜みへComment: 0,0:03:52.26,0:03:53.17,Kanji - Copy - Copy,,0,0,0,karaoke,海｜う#｜みへComment: 0,0:03:54.44,0:03:57.81,Kanji Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,青｜あ#｜おく広｜ひ#｜ろい世｜せ界｜！か#｜いの果｜はてにComment: 0,0:03:57.81,0:04:00.31,Kanji Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,君｜き#｜みと還｜か#｜えるべき場｜ば所｜！しょがあるComment: 0,0:04:00.31,0:04:03.11,Kanji Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,僕｜ぼ#｜くたちは永｜え#｜い遠｜！えんにComment: 0,0:04:03.11,0:04:09.85,Kanji Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,遠｜とおい昔｜＜む#｜か#｜し　そう決｜きめていたComment: 0,0:04:53.50,0:04:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Comment: 0,0:02:38.59,0:02:42.23,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,My heart throbs at the thought of youComment: 0,0:02:42.23,0:02:45.73,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Limitless power surgesComment: 0,0:02:45.73,0:02:48.94,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,As long as you wish,Comment: 0,0:02:48.94,0:02:51.51,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,We'll brandish our unchanging bondComment: 0,0:02:58.95,0:03:05.82,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,The joy of letting our true feelings fly at each otherComment: 0,0:03:05.82,0:03:13.13,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,The pain from how we laughed our heads off to dry our tearsComment: 0,0:03:13.13,0:03:19.97,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,We connect them together and in the wind AhComment: 0,0:03:19.97,0:03:26.74,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,It's fluttering higher and higherComment: 0,0:03:26.74,0:03:29.91,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,Why did you give up on your search?Comment: 0,0:03:29.91,0:03:33.32,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,Why do you keep fighting by yourself?Comment: 0,0:03:33.32,0:03:36.22,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,Say, what kind of future did you prepare for?Comment: 0,0:03:36.22,0:03:39.92,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,Have you fulfilled your dream?Comment: 0,0:03:40.12,0:03:43.99,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Close your eyes and listen carefullyComment: 0,0:03:43.99,0:03:47.43,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Let's look for your answerComment: 0,0:03:47.43,0:03:50.63,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,The road always continues towards the seaComment: 0,0:03:50.63,0:03:53.17,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,That you've never seenComment: 0,0:03:54.44,0:03:57.81,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,At the broad, blue end of the worldComment: 0,0:03:57.81,0:04:00.31,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,There is a place I have to return to with youComment: 0,0:04:00.31,0:04:03.11,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,We will be foreverComment: 0,0:04:03.11,0:04:09.85,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,decided long ago in the pastDialogue: 0,0:00:02.55,0:00:04.79,Main,,0,0,0,,He came out of his castle!Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.06,0:00:14.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Didn't I tell you? We're screwed!Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.61,0:00:20.57,Main,,0,0,0,,There you are, you fleas!Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.44,0:00:24.72,Main,,0,0,0,,We're done for!Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.28,0:01:01.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Germa!Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.60,0:01:02.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.31,0:01:05.85,Main,,0,0,0,,D-Damn... Why do I have to...Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.85,0:01:08.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, fine then!Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.49,0:01:20.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop!Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.10,0:01:25.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Heavenly...Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.88,0:01:30.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Feuer!Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.75,0:01:45.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Reiju!Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.87,0:01:48.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Forget her, Niji! Yonji!Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.34,0:01:52.18,Main,,0,0,0,,It's her fault for being weak! Just fulfill the mission!Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.18,0:01:54.66,Main,,0,0,0,,What a horrid brother I have!Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.66,0:01:57.31,Main,,0,0,0,,It's okay, though! I can handle myself!Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.82,0:02:05.20,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna start with you! Little Germa girl!Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.66,0:02:09.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Rubber-Rubber...Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.44,0:02:13.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Diable Jambe, Crosse...Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.12,0:02:17.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Elephant Gun!Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.54,0:02:19.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Strike!Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.76,0:02:27.24,Main,,0,0,0,,You told me we weren't going all out!Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.24,0:02:30.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I meant you! It's my job!Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.96,0:02:32.48,Main,,0,0,0,,No fair!Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.48,0:02:33.64,Main,,0,0,0,,They jumped out.Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.64,0:02:36.56,Main,,0,0,0,,What are those idiots thinking?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.76,0:04:17.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Why are you guys trying to get away from me?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.42,0:04:29.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you remember what you said to me, Straw Hat? When you were on Fishman Island?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.08,0:04:33.92,Main,,0,0,0,,You said you'd kick my ass.Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.65,0:04:39.96,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Monkey D. Luffy...Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.72,0:04:42.97,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'll remember that name.Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.80,0:04:46.97,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Come! To the New World!Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.93,0:04:51.26,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Sure. Just you wait!Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.48,0:04:56.17,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'll kick your ass in the New World...Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.90,0:05:00.57,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,and make Fishman Island my territory!Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.57,0:05:04.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Remember what you said to me on this island?Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.72,0:05:10.08,Main,,0,0,0,,You said that you'd be the ones to have the last laugh.Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.08,0:05:13.80,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,You're the one who hasn't become the King of the Pirates.Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.80,0:05:15.84,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,That's all.Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.34,0:05:18.84,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'm here to pick another fight with you!Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.84,0:05:22.68,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Don't be cocky just because you're an Emperor!Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.68,0:05:25.19,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'm going to take Sanji back!Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.19,0:05:29.02,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,We're the ones who'll win!Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.02,0:05:33.95,Main,,0,0,0,,And now you're trying to run? You coward!Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.95,0:05:35.68,Main,,0,0,0,,C... C...Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.68,0:05:38.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Co... ward...?Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.23,0:05:43.71,Main,,0,0,0,,– Don't listen to her, Luffy! She's provoking you! – Just one punch!Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.71,0:05:44.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.90,0:05:47.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I said those things!Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.61,0:05:49.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Big Mom!Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.04,0:06:15.92,Main,,0,0,0,,The one that will be the King of the Pirates in the end...Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.56,0:06:24.53,Main,,0,0,0,,is me!Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.90,0:06:54.63,Title,,0,0,420,,You Can Do It, Caesar!!Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.85,0:06:54.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Good job, Germa!Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.69,0:06:57.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Keep protecting me just like that!Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.04,0:06:58.72,Main,,0,0,0,,You fools!Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.22,0:07:01.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Anybody who rebels against Mama...Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.73,0:07:04.92,Main,,0,0,0,,will be burned to death by me!Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.72,0:07:07.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Here comes a terrible one!Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.57,0:07:09.60,Main,,0,0,0,,That damn Oven, then?Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.92,0:07:12.74,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of you two first!Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.04,0:07:22.54,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll leave the rest to you!Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.54,0:07:24.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Burn to death?Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.74,0:07:28.45,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll beat you up before you get a chance!Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.45,0:07:30.47,Main,,0,0,0,,How arrogant!Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.47,0:07:33.16,Main,,0,0,0,,In any case, just get me over the wall!Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.16,0:07:35.54,Main,,0,0,0,,That's all I'm trying to do!Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.10,0:07:38.25,Main,,0,0,0,,There are still more of them!Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.39,0:07:46.63,Main,,0,0,0,,If we clear that wall, we can escape!Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.63,0:07:48.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Lick.Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.44,0:07:51.35,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna let them get away.Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.70,0:07:53.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Candy Wall!Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.23,0:07:58.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.92,0:08:03.57,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.57,0:08:07.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Wh-What the hell is that?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.30,0:08:10.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Perospero must've done it...Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.46,0:08:13.24,Main,,0,0,0,,That was our last hope...Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.10,0:08:21.08,Main,,0,0,0,,It's over... Oh, my freedom...Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.08,0:08:23.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Crap! It'll swallow us! Turn around!Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.87,0:08:26.55,Main,,0,0,0,,No, keep moving forward!Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.56,0:08:36.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Black...Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.42,0:08:37.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Bug!Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.48,0:08:47.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Go!Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.53,0:08:49.32,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! But...Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.25,0:08:59.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Oops...Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.54,0:09:06.43,Main,,0,0,0,,You saved us! Germa 66!Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.43,0:09:10.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Yay! He got through the wall of candy! Only Germa could've done it!Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.57,0:09:14.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Go! Caesar!Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.65,0:09:17.00,Main,,0,0,0,,He's a loser though!Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.67,0:09:22.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Dammit! I got this far now! I don't wanna die!Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.49,0:09:27.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Once I get over the wall, I... I can be...Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.91,0:09:31.08,Main,,0,0,0,,free!!Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.79,0:09:39.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Th-The secret undersea treasure, the Tamate Box, is right there...Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.51,0:09:45.08,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it got stuck right there-nen...Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.67,0:09:48.28,Main,,0,0,0,,I have no choice. I gotta jump off...Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.28,0:09:51.59,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you going to do with the Tamate Box, Du Feld?Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.59,0:09:53.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Y-You're...Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.46,0:09:57.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Stussy! Have you been watching me?Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.29,0:10:06.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow...Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.31,0:10:09.40,Main,,0,0,0,,But now I can see what's in it...Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.68,0:10:16.97,Main,,0,0,0,,The hidden undersea treasure... Let's see what's inside!Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.18,0:10:26.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Flying Finger Pistol...Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.44,0:10:30.20,Main,,0,0,0,,The Tamate Box belongs to the World Government now.Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.28,0:10:30.65,Captions,,50,0,40,,Formerly: Queen of the Pleasure DistrictDialogue: 0,0:10:31.45,0:10:35.62,Captions,,0,0,0,,CP-AIGIS 0 Intelligence Agent StussyDialogue: 0,0:10:33.76,0:10:35.62,Main,,0,0,0,,You fool.Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.62,0:10:39.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Of course, you'll still take the blame for it.Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.66,0:10:42.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Can you write that story for me...?Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.12,0:10:44.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Morgans.Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.12,0:10:44.58,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,She knew I was here!Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.58,0:10:48.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Sure, but can I at least get the scoop on the contents?Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.61,0:10:52.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, go ahead. You sure do know how to play the game.Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.61,0:10:54.47,Main,,0,0,0,,It's no wonder you're such a good spin doctor.Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.47,0:10:56.76,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm a newsman! I'll sue you!Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.23,0:11:02.02,Main,,0,0,0,,– What?! – No!Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.85,0:11:12.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Once I take care of Kaidou...Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.77,0:11:16.65,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm coming back for you!Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.52,0:11:20.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Big Mom!Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.58,0:11:29.33,Main,,0,0,0,,This is nothing!Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.46,0:11:33.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy...Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.17,0:11:38.38,Main,,0,0,0,,You said you'd punch her once!Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.38,0:11:40.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Kaidou?Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.76,0:11:48.52,Main,,0,0,0,,You'll never beat that thing...Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.07,0:11:54.52,Main,,0,0,0,,And more importantly...Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.02,0:12:01.57,Main,,0,0,0,,You must be dreaming if you think you're getting out of my territory alive!Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.45,0:12:09.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Big Mom!Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.39,0:12:14.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Our dream has already ended...Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.25,0:12:19.39,Main,,0,0,0,,in the wake of a dream of just 66 days...Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.39,0:12:23.92,Main,,0,0,0,,our ancestors were left as wandering ghosts unable to set foot on their homeland!Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.39,0:12:28.51,Main,,0,0,0,,And now I have disgraced their memory!Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.44,0:12:36.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Judge!Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.48,0:12:42.34,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I entrusted...Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.34,0:12:47.15,Main,,0,0,0,,a person like you with the soul of three centuries of longing...Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.15,0:12:49.95,Main,,0,0,0,,I despise myself for it!Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.47,0:12:57.19,Main,,0,0,0,,It's not working!Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.00,0:13:01.64,Main,,0,0,0,,No need to worry. You're going to die...Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.64,0:13:05.26,Main,,0,0,0,,and then I shall use your scientific technology...Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.92,0:13:11.64,Main,,0,0,0,,and bring peace to the world!Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.06,0:13:27.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Thunderbolt!Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.19,0:13:33.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Father-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.49,0:13:42.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Did he die?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.78,0:13:43.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Father!Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.69,0:13:45.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait, guards!Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.57,0:13:49.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you guys abandoning us...Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.11,0:14:02.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Katakuri!Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.72,0:14:04.68,Main,,0,0,0,,You were so close.Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.22,0:14:07.22,Main,,0,0,0,,You just had a bit more to go.Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.68,0:14:16.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Sparking...Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.78,0:14:17.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Figure!Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.40,0:14:24.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. We'll do our part! Just go!Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.40,0:14:25.99,Main,,0,0,0,,You don't have to tell me!Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.87,0:14:31.16,Main,,0,0,0,,You think you caught me cold?Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.96,0:14:36.62,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't think you value your life.Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.62,0:14:39.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Threatening me is useless.Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.21,0:14:43.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately... I don't get scared.Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.03,0:14:49.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't let them get away! Shoot, shoot!Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.86,0:14:51.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Go! You can make it-rero!Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.70,0:14:53.54,Main,,0,0,0,,That's it! Go!Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.54,0:14:55.54,Main,,0,0,0,,You can do it, Caesar!Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.54,0:14:57.04,Main,,0,0,0,,You're still a loser, though!Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.04,0:14:58.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? What did you just...Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.84,0:15:04.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Watch out, you...Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.27,0:15:05.05,Main,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.02,0:15:10.95,Main,,0,0,0,,– Hey! Get out of my way! – Hey! Get out of my way!Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.95,0:15:13.31,Main,,0,0,0,,– Huh? Who are you?! – Huh? Who are you?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.86,0:15:17.27,Main,,0,0,0,,– Are you me?! – Are you me?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.27,0:15:20.21,Main,,0,0,0,,– No, you can't be me! – No, you can't be me!Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.21,0:15:24.66,Main,,0,0,0,,It's me, Caesar Clown!Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.66,0:15:25.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Brûlée?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.33,0:15:30.38,Main,,0,0,0,,I won't let you escape!Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.38,0:15:34.39,Main,,0,0,0,,You people did a lot of bad things to me...Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.39,0:15:38.38,Main,,0,0,0,,And now I can finally settle the score!Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.64,0:15:45.76,Main,,0,0,0,,This isn't good, Caesar!Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.11,0:15:59.45,Main,,0,0,0,,They all got taken out?Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.79,0:16:04.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, no...Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.09,0:16:18.13,Main,,0,0,0,,This is the end...Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.80,0:16:22.22,Main,,0,0,0,,No...Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.22,0:16:24.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Germa!Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.35,0:16:29.44,Main,,0,0,0,,If we don't do something, everyone will die.Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.44,0:16:31.02,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't want that!Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.02,0:16:32.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Then...Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.07,0:16:40.41,Main,,0,0,0,,There's only one option.Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.99,0:16:46.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Instead of sitting back and waiting for our deaths...Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.16,0:16:50.04,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll fight, right?Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.04,0:16:52.29,Main,,0,0,0,,– I'm going too! – Me too!Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.29,0:16:54.63,Main,,0,0,0,,We're going too, of course!Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.63,0:16:56.88,Main,,0,0,0,,I have no choice...Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.19,0:17:14.39,Main,,0,0,0,,The Tamate Box!Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.39,0:17:30.56,Main,,0,0,0,,All right, let's begin...Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.56,0:17:33.42,Main,,0,0,0,,the executions.Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.62,0:17:55.04,Main,,0,0,0,,What's going on?Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.48,0:18:24.11,Narrator,,0,0,0,,A short time ago...Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.90,0:18:29.66,Captions,,0,0,0,,Ryugu Kingdom, Fishman IslandDialogue: 0,0:18:29.70,0:18:34.45,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Luffy and the others saved the Ryugu Kingdom from the New Fishman PiratesDialogue: 0,0:18:34.45,0:18:39.14,Narrator,,0,0,0,,and were given the Tamate Box by King Neptune as a reward.Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.14,0:18:40.50,Narrator,,0,0,0,,But...Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.50,0:18:42.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.18,0:18:48.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Regarding all of the treasure you're giving to Luffy-kun and the others if they can find it...Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.36,0:18:52.43,Main,,0,0,0,,do you suppose we could ask for just the Tamate Box back?Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.43,0:18:54.25,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you asking?Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.25,0:18:58.52,Main,,0,0,0,,I'd never ask someone to return a gift I gave them!Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.52,0:19:02.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, what if there isn't treasure inside...Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.27,0:19:04.40,Main,,0,0,0,,but a bomb, instead?Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.40,0:19:05.65,Main,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.65,0:19:08.32,Main,,0,0,0,,It'll explode if they open it?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.32,0:19:10.87,Main,,0,0,0,,I must ask them to return it immediately.Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.33,0:19:17.83,Main,,0,0,0,,You gave all of the treasure... to Big Mom?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.83,0:19:21.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Maybe it won't explode, Minister of the Right.Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.00,0:19:25.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, it's good to think positive.Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.12,0:19:30.02,Captions,,0,970,365,,Whole Cake IslandDialogue: 0,0:19:27.38,0:19:30.01,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Now, back to the present.Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.88,0:19:38.06,Captions,,0,950,345,,Inside Whole Cake ChateauDialogue: 0,0:19:33.49,0:19:35.54,Main,,0,0,0,,From the ceiling of the East Baum Cake second floor,Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.54,0:19:38.73,Main,,0,0,0,,a giant crack is running through the Red-bean Baum Cake Meeting Room!Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.73,0:19:42.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Not just a crack! It's a complete split!Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.61,0:19:46.11,Main,,0,0,0,,This is the Red-bean Baum Cake third floor! What's happening?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.11,0:19:49.03,Main,,0,0,0,,The room is starting to tilt!Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.03,0:19:51.41,Main,,0,0,0,,It's not an earthquake!Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.53,0:19:54.95,Main,,0,0,0,,I heard an enormous explosion earlier!Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.95,0:19:57.95,Main,,0,0,0,,– Are we under attack?! – It won't stop tilting!Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.95,0:19:59.71,Main,,0,0,0,,What's going on?Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.42,0:20:02.79,Main,,0,0,0,,N-No way...Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.38,0:20:06.17,Main,,0,0,0,,It's falling over-bon...Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.97,0:20:09.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Whole Cake Chateau!Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.59,0:20:14.10,Main,,0,0,0,,It's falling over-bon!Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.10,0:20:16.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Cock-a-doodle-do!Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.72,0:20:21.25,Captions,,0,0,0,,Sweet City, the CapitalDialogue: 0,0:20:24.82,0:20:26.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Did an enemy shoot a cannon?Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.61,0:20:31.19,Main,,0,0,0,,We're in the stronghold of an Emperor! How could someone invade this place?!Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.19,0:20:33.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Then it really was an explosion!Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.33,0:20:38.83,Main,,0,0,0,,What in the world just exploded?!Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.83,0:20:40.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Please, make it stop!Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.58,0:20:42.55,Main,,0,0,0,,We're all going to die!Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.55,0:20:45.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Does it have something to do with the rooftop wedding?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.73,0:21:04.82,Main,,0,0,0,,This has to be a joke!Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.94,0:21:08.94,Main,,0,0,0,,But this is big news!Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.45,0:21:15.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Is this... what I think it is?Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.92,0:21:17.17,Main,,0,0,0,,It must be!Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.41,0:21:22.46,Main,,0,0,0,,The timing was dead-on! What else could have exploded like that?Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.11,0:21:26.84,Main,,0,0,0,,But... why the Tamate Box?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.51,0:21:31.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Everyone, hold onto something!Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.14,0:21:36.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Where did Straw Hat and the others go?Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.06,0:21:39.14,Main,,0,0,0,,What just happened?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.14,0:21:40.86,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't know...Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.86,0:21:45.33,Main,,0,0,0,,In any case, it bought us some time! They were just about to kill all of us!Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.16,0:21:55.21,Main,,0,0,0,,What's going on?! What's happening here?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.11,0:22:09.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Something just saved us...Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.79,0:22:12.44,Main,,0,0,0,,I think it's a bit too early...Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.82,0:22:15.86,Main,,0,0,0,,to say that for sure!Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.45,0:22:18.91,Main,,0,0,0,,It's an emergency, Mama!Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.91,0:22:25.12,Main,,0,0,0,,A sudden explosion has caused Whole Cake Chateau to collapse!Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.30,0:22:40.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Something's going on outside!Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.22,0:22:43.59,Main,,0,0,0,,We can't feel anything from inside Bege's body...Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.59,0:22:45.64,Main,,0,0,0,,What is going on?Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.31,0:22:50.64,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure. But...Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.64,0:22:53.52,Main,,0,0,0,,there's a massive panic outside.Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.82,0:22:56.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Could it be...Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.58,0:23:00.61,Main,,0,0,0,,that Whole Cake Chateau itself is shaking?Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.20,0:23:03.32,Main,,0,0,0,,What kind of joke is this?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.32,0:23:06.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Am I dreaming right now?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.45,0:23:10.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Look, Caesar!Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.84,0:23:14.42,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a big mess....Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.30,0:23:19.61,Main,,0,0,0,,How did this happen?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.35,0:23:23.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Who did it and what did they do?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.68,0:23:25.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Brothers...Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.64,0:23:27.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Sisters...Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.10,0:23:30.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, my family!Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.03,0:23:35.19,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't stop!Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.19,0:23:36.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama!Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.82,0:23:52.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama!!Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.46,0:24:10.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Terrific!Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.14,0:24:14.06,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't know who did it, but I gotta thank them!Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.06,0:24:17.19,Main,,0,0,0,,We didn't even have to assassinate her!Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.19,0:24:19.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Now,Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.39,0:24:22.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Emperor Big Mom's pirate crew has been...Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.74,0:24:25.31,Main,,0,0,0,,annihilated!Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.38,0:24:34.76,Main,,0,0,0,,There's no escape!Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.47,0:24:47.44,Main,,0,0,0,,The castle's bigger than the city... We can't escape!Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.44,0:24:50.65,Main,,0,0,0,,No one's fast enough... to run away in time!Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.28,0:25:02.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Big brother!Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.37,0:25:06.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Calm down.Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.08,0:25:14.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Big news! This is big news!Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.59,0:25:16.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Aren't you worried for your own life?Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.84,0:25:19.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, right! I can't fly!Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.52,0:25:25.56,Main,,0,0,0,,But...Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.27,0:25:31.81,Main,,0,0,0,,if this is the end of the Big Mom Pirates,Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.52,0:25:34.61,Main,,0,0,0,,it definitely is big news.Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.28,0:25:45.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.24,0:25:47.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji-kun!Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.74,0:25:49.73,Main,,0,0,0,,This way!Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.73,0:25:51.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Please hurry up!Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.44,0:25:53.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji! Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.83,0:25:57.08,Main,,0,0,0,,You're alive!Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.16,0:26:01.70,Main,,0,0,0,,– Sorry I kept you waiting! – You're too reckless!Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.70,0:26:03.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Honestly!Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.50,0:26:05.72,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm so relieved.Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.09,0:26:08.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Go, Caesar! As far as you can fly!Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.90,0:26:11.09,Main,,0,0,0,,You don't have to tell me that!Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.09,0:26:13.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Run away! Run away! Run away!Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.66,0:26:16.93,Main,,0,0,0,,They're gone.Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.06,0:26:19.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Mission complete!Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.64,0:26:20.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Withdraw!Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.94,0:26:22.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Roger.Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.58,0:26:37.00,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Soft and fluffy...Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.00,0:26:40.33,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Moist and fluffy...Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.33,0:26:44.84,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,In life, there's no such thing.Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.93,0:26:55.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you okay?Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.98,0:27:00.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, no...Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.85,0:27:02.98,Main,,0,0,0,,This is it!Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.27,0:27:06.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Veränderung...Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.27,0:27:06.44,Note,,0,0,0,,TransformationDialogue: 0,0:27:07.38,0:27:08.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Gourmet!Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.34,0:27:36.10,Main,,0,0,0,,What the?!Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.15,0:27:53.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama!Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.26,0:27:55.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama!Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.78,0:28:01.54,Main,,0,0,0,,That was close.Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.50,0:28:13.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Heavy cream?Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.31,0:28:15.76,Main,,0,0,0,,We're gonna get swept away!Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.26,0:28:22.81,Main,,0,0,0,,– Is this... – A sponge cake?Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.25,0:28:39.21,Main,,0,0,0,,What happened?Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.54,0:28:46.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Whole Cake Chateau turned into an actual whole cake...Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.17,0:28:50.73,Main,,0,0,0,,That saved us... The head chef must've done it.Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.73,0:28:53.26,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought I was gonna die!Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.39,0:28:59.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Mama?Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.68,0:29:01.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Cake...Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.41,0:29:04.98,Main,,0,0,0,,My castle turned into a cake...Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.19,0:29:11.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Sweets created by Streusen's ability...Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.75,0:29:15.20,Main,,0,0,0,,will keep you from getting hungry, but they taste bad.Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.20,0:29:15.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama!Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.87,0:29:20.71,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you're okay.Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.96,0:29:27.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Dammit... My wedding cake...Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.47,0:29:31.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Cake...Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.89,0:29:35.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.34,0:29:36.81,Main,,0,0,0,,I need your help!Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.81,0:29:39.56,Main,,0,0,0,,All right! You're okay now.Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.56,0:29:41.44,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought I was gonna die.Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.44,0:29:44.41,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be crushed by the cake!Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.41,0:29:46.52,Main,,0,0,0,,I hear a voice over there!Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.52,0:29:48.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry and help that person!Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.35,0:29:51.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Th-That's...Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.90,0:29:55.37,Main,,0,0,0,,What happened to Pudding-sama's wedding?Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.90,0:29:55.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Mont d'Or-sama! What happened?!Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.37,0:29:58.67,Main,,0,0,0,,We thought the city would be crushed!Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.67,0:30:01.02,Main,,0,0,0,,– Shut up! – What?!Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.02,0:30:03.36,Main,,0,0,0,,It's not over yet!Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.36,0:30:07.49,Main,,0,0,0,,The ones who tried to assassinate Mama got away!Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.49,0:30:10.82,Main,,0,0,0,,They must still be nearby!Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.82,0:30:14.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Contact every Tarte base in Totto Land!Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.78,0:30:19.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't let a single one of...Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.12,0:30:22.20,Main,,0,0,0,,the Straw Hat Pirates or Fire Tank Pirates escape!Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.66,0:30:30.04,Captions,,0,0,0,,Northwestern Side of Whole Cake IslandDialogue: 0,0:30:29.15,0:30:31.42,Main,,0,0,0,,I guess this is far enough.Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.42,0:30:32.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Get out!Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.72,0:30:44.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Bege! We thought we were goners...Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.46,0:30:46.16,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't need your thanks!Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.16,0:30:49.81,Main,,0,0,0,,It makes me sick when I feel like I've done something good.Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.81,0:30:53.53,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who carried you! You jerks!Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.53,0:30:55.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up, loser!Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.11,0:30:59.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you remember what you did to those kids on Punk Hazard?Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.70,0:31:03.20,Main,,0,0,0,,We don't need you anymore, so... go drop dead.Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.53,0:31:08.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! How dare you speak to a genius like that!Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.59,0:31:13.08,Main,,0,0,0,,I could turn this place into a poison gas trap if I wanted to!Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.96,0:31:17.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Here. Take your heart.Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.51,0:31:24.68,Main,,0,0,0,,It's my... my... my...Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.81,0:31:32.79,Main,,0,0,0,,You're free, too.Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.79,0:31:34.53,Main,,0,0,0,,You should've crushed it.Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.44,0:31:36.78,Main,,0,0,0,,No!Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.36,0:31:39.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, please!Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.82,0:31:43.24,Main,,0,0,0,,You should've crushed it.Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.18,0:31:55.18,Main,,0,0,0,,My heart...Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.18,0:31:59.43,Main,,0,0,0,,My heart is back!Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.85,0:32:02.18,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll never cross paths again!Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.18,0:32:06.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, idiots and you stupid girl!Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.27,0:32:07.54,Main,,0,0,0,,– Why did it collapse?Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.54,0:32:09.84,Secondary,,0,0,77,,– Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.54,0:32:09.84,Main,,0,0,0,,– Yeah, it was sudden.Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.84,0:32:11.97,Main,,0,0,0,,– What happened?Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.32,0:32:11.97,Secondary,,0,0,77,,– Bye!Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.97,0:32:13.43,Secondary,,0,0,77,,– Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.97,0:32:13.43,Main,,0,0,0,,– I have no idea.Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.43,0:32:15.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys!Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.82,0:32:17.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Father!Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.73,0:32:21.16,Main,,0,0,0,,As far as I can tell, it looks like Big Mom...Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.16,0:32:23.91,Main,,0,0,0,,and her family have all survived-rero!Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.57,0:32:28.44,Main,,0,0,0,,The fallen castle turned into an actual cake!Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.44,0:32:32.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Streusen must've done it.Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.08,0:32:37.37,Main,,0,0,0,,He's always been a mystery to me.Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.92,0:32:43.68,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he's more than just the head chef.Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.68,0:32:46.85,Main,,0,0,0,,He's probably pretty tough in a fight.Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.72,0:32:52.44,Main,,0,0,0,,So, the Big Mom pirates aren't totally wiped out...Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.44,0:32:54.87,Main,,0,0,0,,they've got good luck.Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.65,0:32:58.61,Main,,0,0,0,,But it's fine. The Chateau collapsed.Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.61,0:33:00.57,Main,,0,0,0,,I can feel good about that.Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.57,0:33:03.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.41,0:33:05.69,Main,,0,0,0,,So, all that's left is to get away!Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.69,0:33:10.19,Main,,0,0,0,,That's always been the plan... We just hit the biggest obstacles right at the start!Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.19,0:33:12.75,Main,,0,0,0,,All right. Let's run, then.Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.75,0:33:15.74,Main,,0,0,0,,This is where we part ways, Straw Hat.Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.74,0:33:17.59,Main,,0,0,0,,What? Is that so?Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.59,0:33:20.42,Main,,0,0,0,,We weren't able to assassinate Big Mom...Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.42,0:33:23.91,Main,,0,0,0,,so there's no reason for us to keep working together.Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.91,0:33:28.10,Main,,0,0,0,,You're right about that. And you guys had best hurry, too.Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.10,0:33:33.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Even by ship, it'll take you a full day to get out of Big Mom's territory.Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.17,0:33:34.52,Main,,0,0,0,,That's true!Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.52,0:33:36.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Good luck!Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.77,0:33:40.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Castle Tank!Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.87,0:33:50.58,Note,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hats went that way. ->Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.87,0:33:50.58,Main,,0,0,0,,"The Straw Hats went that way"?Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.58,0:33:52.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Is this sign really necessary?!Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.96,0:33:55.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up! It's every man for himself now!Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.46,0:33:59.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Father! At least let us say goodbye-rero!Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.24,0:34:02.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Nami's my friend now!Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.05,0:34:06.22,Main,,0,0,0,,We ain't here to make friends! It's time to begin the real escape!Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.30,0:34:11.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay, we'll go pick up the Shark Submerge...Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.05,0:34:14.09,Main,,0,0,0,,and bring it right back to the Sunny!Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.09,0:34:16.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Be careful!Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.55,0:34:20.10,Main,,0,0,0,,We're going to hurry back to the coastline where we landed!Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.87,0:34:24.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Assemble two squads, Daifuku.Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.11,0:34:25.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay.Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.95,0:34:29.75,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll split up into two groups and pursue them!Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.75,0:34:35.55,Main,,0,0,0,,One group, bring back Straw Hat's head! And the other, bring back Bege's!Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.35,0:34:42.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama.Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.39,0:34:49.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. We won't let any of them escape...Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.21,0:34:51.27,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Cake...Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.19,0:34:57.03,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Its ingredients were carefully selected...Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.03,0:35:00.94,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,It was going to be the best wedding cake ever...Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.94,0:35:05.99,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I was looking forward to it...Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.96,0:35:16.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Wedding cake...Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.90,0:35:19.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama?Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.93,0:35:29.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Where's my wedding cake?!Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.56,0:35:32.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Not now...Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.48,0:35:35.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Bring it to me now!Dialogue: 1,0:02:38.09,